  "id": "tip-of-the-tongue-phenomenon",
  "term": "tip-of-the-tongue phenomenon",
  "definition": "The tip-of-the-tongue phenomenon is a temporary word-finding problem in which a person knows the word they want but cannot retrieve it at that moment. In the supplied source, it is described as a language-related experience that becomes more common in older adults.",
